    "Original approximations of fine relief,urns/clock details,dormer/chimney/window inventories,hidden roof joints andinterior levels. No copied royal arms,inscriptions,sculptures orprivate textures. Exterior only;the deep clock-court recess has closed rear doors because the pictures do not prove a through passage. Physical laptop/phone timing andLOD error estimates remain unmeasured.",
